BLIND RESULTS (referee's own program ref.c, written before opening anything in /home/agent2/meander/)
choices: nodes h=0.1 (uniform resampling by 4-point Lagrange when a spacing leaves [0.6h,1.4h] or after a cut),
 Menger (three-point circle) curvature, integral exact for piecewise-linear kappa by recursion round the valley,
 explicit Euler dt=0.001, neck search every 5 steps (cells of size dc, closest qualifying pair cut first,
 repeat until none; loop across the seam handled; gap filled with straight nodes). LX=200, noise sd 0.01 per node.
 S sampled every 0.1 time; "second half" = samples with t > T/2.

